Index S12_Ext_Scenario
Title: S12 Ext Scenario
Definition: Concat(S12_Interventions, Scenario)
NodeLocation: 112,128,1
NodeSize: 64,24
WindState: 2,0,0,720,350

Variable S12_Scenario
Title: S12 Scenario
Definition: Table(Scenario,S12_Interventions)(~
Checkbox(0),Checkbox(0),Checkbox(0),~
Checkbox(1),Checkbox(0),Checkbox(0),~
Checkbox(1),Checkbox(1),Checkbox(1),~
Checkbox(1),Checkbox(1),Checkbox(1))
