Variable Effect_Start
Title: Effect Start
Definition: Table(S12_Interventions)(Choice(Time,1,0),Choice(Time,1,0),Choice(Time,1,0))
NodeLocation: 328,288,1
NodeSize: 64,24
WindState: 2,0,0,720,350
ValueState: 2,40,50,400,300,0,MIDM
Aliases: FormNode Fo329582675

Close S12_Intervention_Det

Variable CRE_Emissions_Interv
Title: CRE Emissions Intervention Mod.
Units: ktonCO2e
Description: Emissions per geography per year modified by interventions.
Definition: IF S12_Ext_Scenario_Com[S12_Interventions='Taiwan Renewable'] AND S12_Geography='Taiwan' AND S12_Utility='Electricity'~
	THEN 0~
ELSE IF S12_Geography='Taiwan' AND S12_Utility = 'Electricity'~
	THEN CRE_vs_non_CRE[EF_Type='Location']~
~
ELSE IF S12_Ext_Scenario_Com[S12_Interventions='Korea Renewable'] AND S12_Geography='Korea' AND S12_Utility='Electricity'~
	THEN 0~
ELSE IF S12_Geography='Korea' AND S12_Utility = 'Electricity'~
	THEN CRE_vs_non_CRE[EF_Type='Location']~
~
ELSE CRE_vs_non_CRE[EF_Type='Market']
